{"parse": {"title": "WPK-03", "pageid": 59795, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/WPK-02\" title=\"WPK-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">WPK-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/WPK-04\" title=\"WPK-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">WPK</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E6.B3.89.E6.B0.B4.E7.B2.BE.E7.81.B5.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“泉水精灵”\">“泉水精灵”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “泉水精灵”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">\"Spring Elfin\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>噢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>泉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>水<span class=\"color-value\"></span>精<span class=\"color-value\"></span>灵<span class=\"color-value\"></span>啊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>～<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>歌<span class=\"color-value\"></span>颂<span class=\"color-value\"></span>她<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>名<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191403</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>活泼的姑娘坐在椅子上，眉头紧锁。餐盘里的食物芬芳牢牢地勾住了她的鼻尖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>不——兔妈妈不会喜欢圆滚滚的姑娘……我必须控制住自己……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>……可是老天爷，你究竟有多残忍，才要让我看到这条促销广告……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301416.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-301416.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301416.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301416.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-301416.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301416.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/30/HeadIconSmall-301416.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301416.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>“俱乐部全天无限供应免费巧克力蜂蜜巴菲，即日生效！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭妮芭妮发出一声悲鸣，被揉成纸团的俱乐部传单远远地飘飞出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>传单在空中划出一道漂亮的弧线，掠过灯座与窗台——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>精准地跃入小巧的陶罐之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“咕噜咕噜——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-303020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-303020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-303020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陶罐汩汩地涌出清泉，像是即将喷发的火山口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个小巧的脑袋从水雾中探出头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-303010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-303010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-303010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>阿嚏——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>到底是谁又在偷偷许愿——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>心怀愤怒的脑袋不满地摇晃着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>哇啊！……拉拉泉小姐？你怎么会蹲在这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过分亲昵的话语让拉拉泉停止了嘟哝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>不、不用在意我，我一点儿也不生气！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她扬了扬眉头，似乎想到了更重要的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>咳咳……你看起来愁眉苦脸的，一定有什么心事吧？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>我……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭妮芭妮迟疑地摸了摸自己的肚子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>……我表现得这么明显吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉久违地占据了上风。她悄悄地握了握拳，显然不打算放过这一证明自己的好机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>也许你曾经有许多烦恼，也许你有许多问题没法解决……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>但是，仁慈的泉水精灵很乐意大发慈悲地为你帮忙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>哇——你是来帮助芭妮芭妮的吗？你能帮我把肚子里的食物转换成别的东西么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>最好，它们能被轻松消化掉，而不会显现在我的肚子上～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>哼，这个愿望要比那位数字小姐的简单多了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉将手伸进水罐，毫不在意地捞出了那张湿透的传单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>滴滴闪着金光的泉水顺着相似的轨迹流淌而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终凝成了一杯金色的泉水。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>喝下这杯“不灵不灵泉”，你吃下的所有东西最后都会变成泉水～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她压低喘气的声音，努力维持着许愿天使应有的从容与美好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>好了！尽情去享用巧克力芭菲吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>真、真的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭妮芭妮毫不犹豫地一饮而尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮 ：</div><div>谢谢你，拉拉泉小姐，你真是一个伟大的天使——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她欢呼雀跃地拥起拉拉泉，年幼的孩童显然对此殊荣相当受用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>哼哼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而后，前来寻求“不灵不灵泉”的兔女郎们几乎堵塞了陶罐的罐口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉收获了追捧，收获了褒奖与拥戴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一次成功的宣传，也是一个成功的愿望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不论是对于拉拉泉，还是对于芭妮芭妮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当然，除了兔女郎俱乐部与那终日人满为患的洗手池。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>偶尔……成为泉水精灵的感觉也不赖嘛～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>不会有比我更成功的许愿精灵了——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她想起了那个揶揄她的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>到时候，她一定会哭丧着脸，向我道歉的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“约翰·提托”：</div><div>拉拉泉小姐，对不起！我真诚地为我的恶劣行为向您道歉——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>哼，现在知道泉水精灵的厉害了吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“约翰·提托”：</div><div>请宽恕我的愚昧和无知吧，最伟大的天使拉拉泉大人，请允许我与您成为朋友——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-303601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-303601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-303601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“约翰·提托”：</div><div>不，不——我会向我的朋友传颂您的故事，让他们也成为您的信徒，让您拥有更多、更多的朋友——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>这个嘛，让我好好考虑一下……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xuexiaozoulang\"><img alt=\"xuexiaozoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/600px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/900px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/1200px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-303001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>嘿嘿～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉拉泉旁若无人地发笑，像是某种电影中被附身的恶灵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而这一切恰巧落入某个不慎路过的朋友眼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>抱、抱歉，我似乎来的不是时候……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>我只是想实现愿望，我还肩负着一个数十人的剧团……乡下还有几片农田……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>请不要杀害我——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>嘿嘿嘿～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夏利此生参加过无数剧团排练。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她还从未见过有人会在走廊手舞足蹈地练习播种技巧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以如此投入的方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>对不起，我这就离开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>咳咳——说出你的愿望吧～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉拉泉：</div><div>最伟大的许愿天使正在侧耳聆听呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-301701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏利：</div><div>我、我的愿望是……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "WPK-03"}}